imized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614048570","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102028#issuecomment-2614048570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102028","id":2614048570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bzzc6","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T17:59:52Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T17:59:52Z","body":"I just realize that the type is Vector2 although get_width and get_height are int. I'll change the type back then.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614048570/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614050926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102028#issuecomment-2614050926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102028","id":2614050926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bz0Bu","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T18:06:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T18:06:56Z","body":"> I have tested a bit and found some issues.我测试了一些，发现了一些问题。\r\n> \r\n> * I can not select by clicking on the area covered by the \"selected object orange rectangle\" gizmo when image size is negative.当图像大小为负数时，我无法通过单击“selected object orange rectangle”（选定对象橙色矩形）gizmo 覆盖的区域进行选择。\r\n> \r\n> ( having created selection systems in my game i think this is probably because areas do not generate properly with negative numbers, but i could be wrong )（在我的游戏中创建了选择系统后，我认为这可能是因为区域没有正确生成负数，但我可能是错的）\r\n> \r\n> -The orange selection rectangle scales appropriately with changes to \"image size\" but not with the \"scale\" parameter.- 橙色选择矩形会随着 “image size” 的更改而适当缩放，但不会随着 “scale” 参数的更改而缩放。\r\n\r\nThe image size matches the true size of the texture and the orange selection. Negative size are not allowed. I will make changes to avoid negative numbers.\r\nThe scale does not affect size, only applies to the content.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{