":"2025-02-18T01:32:38Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T04:12:43Z","body":"Currently there isn't a good way to achieve it. If we use viewport, there are many properties of viewport that haven't been exposed ( msaa, debanding, etc, adding these properties to MeshTexture is strange for users ). And there might be performance issues when creating lots of viewports, for example, if it's used for the Mesh2D mode of AtlasTextureImporter, the performance could be worse than the original implementation.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2664358346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2665512927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102028#issuecomment-2665512927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102028","id":2665512927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6e4H_f","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-18T12:09:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T12:09:39Z","body":"It is worth noting that in this PR when updating the texture, it will redraw all viewports, so it may depend on this proposal\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1010","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2665512927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]